# The deployed origin, with no trailing slash — e.g. https://jordancraig.dev
# It is substituted into index.html at build time for the canonical URL,
# the Open Graph tags and the JSON-LD. Left empty, those resolve to
# root-relative paths, which work for the page itself but give link
# previews no absolute image URL. Set it (here or in the host's
# environment variables) before going public.
VITE_SITE_URL=
